---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor calls withdrawExcessInvestedCapital(signature)
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: contract not paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid or replayed
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_claimed: signature valid
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: position.hasClaimedExcess == true
    q_check_claimed --> q_calc_excess: position.hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert ExcessAlreadyClaimed
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_excess: excessAmount = position.investedCapital - newSaftApprovedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_no_excess: excessAmount <= 0
    q_check_excess --> q_update: excessAmount > 0
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.hasClaimedExcess = true, position.investedCapital -= excessAmount
    q_transfer --> q_mark_sig: transfer excessAmount bidToken to investor
    q_mark_sig --> q_emit: mark signature as used
    q_emit --> [*]: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(investor, excessAmount)

    note right of q_calc_excess
        INV-001: Excess = investedCapital - updated SAFT-approved amount (from new signature)
        INV-002: Requires signature proving reduced allocation terms
        INV-003: hasClaimedExcess prevents double-claiming
    end note
